  "rationale": "The workflow already caches dependency downloads (buildx binary, buildx cache, and Docker images) via actions/cache@v6, so the P-LIT-GHA-CACHE dependency-cache optimization is contraindicated because an equivalent cache already exists. No other pattern's preconditions are satisfied: there is no matrix (P-LIT-FAIL-FAST), no schedule (schedule/suppression patterns), no tests (test selection/prioritization), no Bazel build, and no completed-run history to derive a safe custom timeout (P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT requires representative successful-duration history; the repository reports no completed runs). Adding an arbitrary timeout risks breaking valid slow builds, so no supported change preserves coverage and safety.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT"]
}
